## Filament Storybook PH (josephdlmd/filament-storybook-ph)

- This app keeps Philippine books: VAT, withholding, TINs and BIR forms come from this package's patterns, which layer on filament-storybook's (`php artisan storybook:list` shows both; each PH pattern names the core one it builds on). Call its `DocumentTotals` and `PrintedDocument` in place of the core ones, and follow its rules, which `php artisan storybook:instructions` returns after the core rules.
